# Code Owners — zendesk_exporter
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# This file defines code ownership for review requests.
# Requires branch protection with "Require review from Code Owners" enabled.
#
# Pattern syntax:
#   *              — default owner (everything not matched)
#   src/*.py       — Python source code
#   .github/       — CI/CD and workflow files
#   config/        — Configuration files

# Default: all changes require review
* @usurachai

# Source code — critical, requires careful review
src/ @usurachai

# CI/CD — infrastructure changes
.github/ @usurachai

# Config — training and export settings
config/ @usurachai

# Documentation — can be reviewed by anyone
*.md @usurachai

# Scripts — training and export scripts
*.sh @usurachai
